{"id": "86269", "name": "Logs_2", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Find all real solutions, if any, of the following equation</p>\n<p>\\[ {{CT:0}} \\sinh(x) + {{CT:0}} \\cosh(x) - {{CT:1}} = 0 .\\]</p>\n<p>(Do not use arcsinh or arccosh or arctanh in your answer. Express you answer in terms of a logarithm.)</p>\n<p>\\( x = \\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>If \\[ {{CT:0}} \\sinh(x) + {{CT:0}} \\cosh(x) - {{CT:1}} = 0 .\\]then \\[ {{CT:0}} \\sinh(x) + {{CT:0}} \\cosh(x) = {{CT:1}} .\\]</p>\n<p>\\[  \\sinh(x) +  \\cosh(x) = {{CT:2}}.\\]</p>\n<p>Therefore\\[  \\frac{e^{x}-e^{-x}}{2} +  \\frac{e^{x}+e^{-x}}{2} = {{CT:2}}.\\]</p>\n<p>\\[  e^{x} = {{CT:2}}.\\]</p>\n<p>and \\[x ={{CT:3}}\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "ta